Yo, check it, lemme break it down for ya, real quick
'Bout the Fed, the big boss, the financial trick.

(Verse 1)
They ain't no gang, ain't slingin' no crack
But they control the money, ain't no turnin' back.
Think of 'em as the DJ, spinnin' the tracks
Of the whole damn economy, keepin' it on the right tracks.

(Chorus)
The Fed, the Fed, they runnin' the show
Keepin' prices steady, makin' the money flow.
They the silent partners, behind the scenes
Makin' sure the whole damn system gleams.

(Verse 2)
When the economy's slow, they drop the rates
Makin' it cheaper to borrow, openin' up the gates.
Businesses investin', people spendin' more
The whole damn economy starts to soar.

(Chorus)
The Fed, the Fed, they runnin' the show
Keepin' prices steady, makin' the money flow.
They the silent partners, behind the scenes
Makin' sure the whole damn system gleams.

(Bridge)
But when things get hot, inflation's on the rise
They gotta step in, gotta equalize.
They raise the rates, slow things down a bit
Keepin' the economy from goin' off the grid.

(Chorus)
The Fed, the Fed, they runnin' the show
Keepin' prices steady, makin' the money flow.
They the silent partners, behind the scenes
Makin' sure the whole damn system gleams.

(Outro)
So next time you hear 'bout the Fed, don't be confused
They the financial guardians, keepin' things smooth.
They ain't perfect, but they doin' their best
To keep the economy stable, puttin' it to the test. [end of text]


